<ontology/use_glass_ceramics/use_glass_ceramics__0557__q2/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. GLASS" ;
